00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:45.880
We had gotten down to about 12000 cases a
day, by the way, still more than the ten thousand

00:00:45.880 --> 00:00:51.490
case per day mark that Dr. Anthony Fauci established
over a year ago as sort of like we need to

00:00:51.490 --> 00:00:53.550
