00:01:35.730 --> 00:01:41.320
And if you do have a symptomatic vaccinated
case, it's likely not to be serious.

00:01:41.320 --> 00:01:43.030
You're not likely to be hospitalized.

00:01:43.030 --> 00:01:44.140
You're not likely to die.

00:01:44.140 --> 00:01:45.550
But nothing is perfect.

00:01:45.550 --> 00:01:47.960
Everything is bell curve distribution.

00:01:47.960 --> 00:01:53.200
And some vaccinated people who do everything
right will get sick and they will die.

00:01:53.200 --> 00:01:58.240
And every person who chooses not to get vaccinated
makes that more likely.

00:01:58.240 --> 00:02:02.490
